   ],
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Medium-wide, tracking alongside  [STREET]\n\nThe girl walks: bareheaded, long fair curls with snow on them, thin\nragged dress, old apron full of matches, bundle in one hand, shuffling\nin a pair of far-too-big worn adult slippers."
  },
  {
   "id": "s03",
   "dur": 4.9583,
   "in": 10.208,
   "out": 15.167,
   "lines": [
    "3"
   ],
   "src": null,
   "bg": "0x1b2240",
   "slate": "Wide, then she jumps back; end on her feet  [STREET]\n\nTwo dark carriages with horses rush past through snow; she leaps\naside; both slippers fly off; a ragged boy snatches one and runs off\nlaughing; end on her BARE feet, red and blue in the snow. From here on\nshe is barefoot."
  },
